1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,238
How many bubbles can you count?

2
00:00:05,238 --> 00:00:06,636
One, two, three!

3
00:00:06,636 --> 00:00:08,181
Three big bubbles!

4
00:00:08,731 --> 00:00:09,425
Pop! Pop!

5
00:00:09,425 --> 00:00:09,831
Pop!

6
00:00:11,531 --> 00:00:12,719
Pip sneezed,

7
00:00:12,719 --> 00:00:14,857
so now we wash our paws.

8
00:00:15,107 --> 00:00:17,430
Warm water, and soap!

9
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,815
Let's scrub and count to ten.

10
00:00:21,065 --> 00:00:22,896
Count with us!

11
00:00:23,896 --> 00:00:26,434
One, two, three, four, five!

12
00:00:27,034 --> 00:00:29,611
Six, seven, eight, nine, ten!

13
00:00:31,461 --> 00:00:33,603
Scrub the fronts, the backs,

14
00:00:33,603 --> 00:00:34,847
and in between!

15
00:00:35,397 --> 00:00:37,955
Can you rub your hands together?

16
00:00:38,205 --> 00:00:39,897
Rub, rub, rub!

17
00:00:42,797 --> 00:00:44,199
Rinse, and dry.

18
00:00:44,199 --> 00:00:45,835
Clean, clean paws!

19
00:00:46,085 --> 00:00:46,835
Woof!

20
00:00:47,385 --> 00:00:49,090
Share with a friend and

21
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:51,253
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

22
00:00:51,753 --> 00:00:53,322
Watch the full story

23
00:00:53,322 --> 00:00:54,890
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
